 * - All non-empty content (with or without fences) generates at least one block
 * - Plain markdown (no fences) defaults to type='markdown' for MarkdownViewer
 * 
 * NAMED BLOCK FIX:
 * - Blocks with language + filename only close on matching closing fence
 * - Inner fences (with or without info) are treated as content, not block markers
