 * - Markdown blocks (type='markdown') treat ALL inner fences as content,
 *   even if they have language info (mermaid, python, etc.)
 * - Code blocks (type='py', 'js', etc.) only close on matching closing fence
 * - Future-proof: any language/diagram type is handled uniformly
